  "description": "Kuro Spirit is a fierce hand-drawn Japanese brush calligraphy font built for designs that demand attitude, movement, and raw personality. Inspired by the collision of traditional Asian brushwork, rebellious Japanese street culture, underground fashion, and cinematic action, every letter carries the energy of ink dragged rapidly across paper.\nKuro Spirit is especially powerful when used large. Build commanding movie titles, Japanese-inspired streetwear graphics, martial arts posters, gaming logos, manga-inspired artwork, album covers, restaurant branding, packaging, merchandise, tattoos, book covers, and bold editorial layouts. Its expressive brush texture instantly transforms simple words into graphic artwork.\nWhether you’re creating a futuristic Tokyo campaign, an underground clothing label, a samurai-inspired game, a ramen restaurant identity, or a cinematic title sequence, Kuro Spirit brings tradition and rebellion together in one unforgettable typeface.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Kuro Spirit is a fierce hand-drawn Japanese brush calligraphy font built for designs that demand attitude, movement, and raw personality. Inspired by the collision of traditional Asian brushwork, rebellious Japanese street culture, underground fashion, and cinematic action, every letter carries the energy of ink dragged rapidly across paper.</p>\n<p>Kuro Spirit is especially powerful when used large. Build commanding movie titles, Japanese-inspired streetwear graphics, martial arts posters, gaming logos, manga-inspired artwork, album covers, restaurant branding, packaging, merchandise, tattoos, book covers, and bold editorial layouts. Its expressive brush texture instantly transforms simple words into graphic artwork.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating a futuristic Tokyo campaign, an underground clothing label, a samurai-inspired game, a ramen restaurant identity, or a cinematic title sequence, Kuro Spirit brings tradition and rebellion together in one unforgettable typeface.</p>",
